{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"956be2b04214db19780e01b529abc516870af81b7caac5d3da44a6ed84459974","ja":"イタズラの行方","zh":"恶作剧的去向","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c9e8a7fac4711ceef3fb69e2e84d30bf2d3a765d53f65f784ab6e34325a284cf","ja":"すみません、遅くなりましたー……って、\nあれっ！？　この部屋、すっごく暑くないですか？","zh":"不好意思，我来晚了～……不对，\n咦！？这个房间，是不是非常热啊？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"7ef05054b4c28ba506cfcda944e575aaa35fefc7e64efa8549d504e75573cc19","ja":"はぁはぁ……た、助けて、ミキミキ、やよいっち！\n亜美……もう無理だよ～っ！","zh":"哈啊哈啊……救、救救我，美希美希、弥生亲！\n亚美……已经不行了啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"c45bfab5738764eb2065baf6940de8f4095f7da61a484b984c393df03437dd06","ja":"はぁはぁ……真美も、も、もうだめ～……。","zh":"哈啊、哈啊……真美也、也、已经不行了～……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"c82613587d0eae9898ac59711103952037947be986c7cdaa6bb256a65d3d0e5a","ja":"はぁはぁ。ふたりとも、もうギブアップ？\n燃えてたんじゃなかったのかしら？","zh":"哈啊，哈啊。你们两个，这就认输了吗？\n刚才不是还斗志昂扬的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9b9f6849d347419fdb695ddbcb66cf6ec551b86ae6a0afc477e0d35411e36589","ja":"ううっ……も、燃え上がりすぎて、\nもう灰になっちゃいそうだよ～！","zh":"呜呜……燃、燃烧得太旺，\n我都快化成灰了啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"9bebecc0284e48d35b5ff0bac49d4393e3fe5179f165a661a57996435d71a638","ja":"まったく……これにこりたら、\nつまらないイタズラはしないことね！","zh":"真是的……吃到了这次的教训，\n就别再去搞那些无聊的恶作剧了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"597f65cccc70e575361734624983494309c6ae4c696caf4a87dea6f9d793a8c3","ja":"わ、わかったよぉ……律っちゃんの鬼軍曹……。","zh":"我、我知道了啦……小律这个魔鬼教官……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"08a8e765226deff2181720070e836220d7c117584793957bde5f6f14ca6b2545","ja":"なにか言ったかしら、真美？","zh":"你刚才说了什么吗，真美？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"744b12be4c887963197c8a8362a92301c2ccb211600144a961838eaf7bd1df75","ja":"な、なんでもないであります！","zh":"没、没什么事！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"18ac94fa52c683c141ece367e412cb8cd65879a8e1dbaf3e3b1b4957f16168df","ja":"あはは……亜美と真美が、\nまた何かしたみたいですね。","zh":"啊哈哈……亚美和真美，\n好像又做了什么呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"d91d68992785ae5e5297146a010f473dc1f09e015949e83d1d060cf3b7a30c20","ja":"よくわかんないけど、\nミキ、この部屋でレッスンしたくないって思うな。","zh":"美希不太清楚，\n不过美希觉得不想在这个房间练习呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"4c01067fc464ae231d6c76efbc5a293ab60e09294a8c44cde217d0a982ed7d5e","ja":"そうね。みんなそろったことだし、部屋の空気を\n入れ替えて、レッスンを再開しましょうか。","zh":"也是呢。既然大家都到齐了，就先给房间\n换换气，然后重新开始练习吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"57bf93b92e51235490cd32b979431d298e906cc8620c0d47ac6bbbb7ccb075f6","ja":"ええ～っ！　亜美たち、\nもういっぱいレッスンしたっしょ？","zh":"诶诶～！我们\n已经练了超级多了吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"a08636e91a5cf8b7e52117f7d0c36c17eb67139736e6894d01596b65c6f89432","ja":"これ以上レッスンしたら、\n本当に燃え尽きちゃうよ～……！","zh":"要是再继续练习下去，\n真的要彻底燃尽了啦～……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1379.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"60fcfe23f04ef7f39a0f82f9a182ed305622ff0afa21c2d56351be8e9d674327","ja":"自業自得でしょ！　つべこべ言ってないで、\n太陽のように熱くなるまでレッスンするわよ！","zh":"这是自作自受吧！别再废话了，\n给我练习到像太阳一样滚烫为止！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
